# Phase 7: a program runs in ring 3, prints through write(1, ...), and its
# exit status is reported by the kernel. init is running (it shows in ps).
cpu: protections on:
fs: / from the boot archive
init: started as pid 1
cerberus kernel shell
!send run /bin/hello first second
!wait 2
hello: written with write(1, ...)
hello: user mode, pid
3 argument(s) ("three"), program name /bin/hello
run: /bin/hello exited with status 42
!send run /bin/none
!wait 2
exited with status 127
!send ps
!wait 1
init
